{"seq":2,"slug":"content-based-filtering","title":"基于内容的推荐算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommendation-algorithms/foundations/content-based-filtering","wordCount":1310,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"基于内容的推荐算法\">基于内容的推荐算法</h1><p>当一个全新物品刚上架、还没有任何用户交互数据时，协同过滤完全无法为其生成推荐。内容过滤（Content-Based Filtering, CBF）提供了另一条路径：直接分析物品的属性特征，将其与用户过去喜欢的物品进行匹配。它不依赖群体行为，只需要&quot;你过去喜欢什么样的东西&quot;就能工作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念与工作机制\">核心概念与工作机制</h2><p>内容过滤的核心假设是<strong>用户偏好具有一致性</strong>——如果一个用户过去喜欢动作电影，未来大概率也喜欢动作电影。系统通过构建物品的特征表示和用户的兴趣画像来实现匹配。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[物品内容属性] --&gt; B[特征提取]&#10;    B --&gt; C[物品特征向量]&#10;    D[用户历史行为] --&gt; E[画像构建]&#10;    E --&gt; F[用户兴趣向量]&#10;    C --&gt; G{相似度计算}&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[推荐列表]\">graph TD\n    A[物品内容属性] --&gt; B[特征提取]\n    B --&gt; C[物品特征向量]\n    D[用户历史行为] --&gt; E[画像构建]\n    E --&gt; F[用户兴趣向量]\n    C --&gt; G{相似度计算}\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[推荐列表]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>内容过滤</th>\n<th>协同过滤</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>核心信号</td>\n<td>物品属性 + 用户画像</td>\n<td>用户-物品交互行为</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冷启动物品</td>\n<td>天然支持</td>\n<td>完全失效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冷启动用户</td>\n<td>需少量行为建画像</td>\n<td>完全失效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>惊喜度</td>\n<td>低（局限于已知兴趣）</td>\n<td>高（能发现跨类别兴趣）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特征工程成本</td>\n<td>高（需要领域知识）</td>\n<td>低（只需交互日志）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>覆盖率</td>\n<td>高（每个物品都可计算）</td>\n<td>低（长尾物品无信号）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"物品特征表示\">物品特征表示</h2><h3 id=\"结构化特征\">结构化特征</h3><p>结构化特征是最直接的物品描述方式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>电商场景</strong>：品类、品牌、价格区间、材质、颜色、尺寸</li>\n<li><strong>视频场景</strong>：类型标签、时长、导演、演员、发布时间</li>\n<li><strong>音乐场景</strong>：流派、BPM、调性、乐器、年代</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些特征可以直接编码为多热向量（multi-hot vector）或通过 Embedding 映射到稠密空间。</p>\n<h3 id=\"非结构化特征提取\">非结构化特征提取</h3><p>现代内容推荐的核心突破在于能从非结构化数据中自动提取语义特征：</p>\n<p><strong>文本特征</strong>：从 TF-IDF 到 BERT 语义编码的演进路径：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>TF-IDF：统计词频-逆文档频率，简单有效但丢失语序</li>\n<li>Word2Vec 均值：取词向量平均作为文档表示</li>\n<li>BERT/Sentence-BERT：端到端语义编码，捕捉深层含义</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>视觉特征</strong>：利用预训练 CNN/ViT 提取图像表示：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>ResNet 的倒数第二层输出作为 2048 维视觉特征</li>\n<li>CLIP 模型可直接对齐文本与图像到同一语义空间</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>多模态融合</strong>：将文本、图像、音频等多种模态特征拼接或通过注意力机制融合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用户兴趣建模\">用户兴趣建模</h2><h3 id=\"显式画像\">显式画像</h3><p>直接从用户标注的偏好构建：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>profile</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>u</mi><mo>+</mo></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>u</mi><mo>+</mo></msubsup></mrow></munder><mtext>feat</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>u</mi><mo>−</mo></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>u</mi><mo>−</mo></msubsup></mrow></munder><mtext>feat</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{profile}(u) = \\frac{1}{|I_u^+|} \\sum_{i \\in I_u^+} \\text{feat}(i) - \\frac{1}{|I_u^-|} \\sum_{i \\in I_u^-} \\text{feat}(i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">profile</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.8295em;vertical-align:-1.5081em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6973em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8421em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7027em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.214em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.286em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5081em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">feat</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.8295em;vertical-align:-1.5081em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6973em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8421em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7027em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.214em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.286em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5081em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">feat</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>u</mi><mo>+</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_u^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0183em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>u</mi><mo>−</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_u^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0183em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 分别是用户明确表示喜欢和不喜欢的物品集合。</p>\n<h3 id=\"隐式画像与衰减\">隐式画像与衰减</h3><p>实际系统中用户很少给出显式反馈，需要从隐式行为推断兴趣。引入时间衰减因子：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>profile</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>u</mi></msub></mrow></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>feat</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{profile}(u) = \\sum_{i \\in I_u} w_i \\cdot e^{-\\lambda(t_{now} - t_i)} \\cdot \\text{feat}(i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">profile</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4444em;vertical-align:-1.3944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">λ</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">feat</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为行为权重（购买 &gt; 加购 &gt; 点击 &gt; 浏览），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 控制衰减速率。</p>\n<h3 id=\"多兴趣表示\">多兴趣表示</h3><p>用户往往有多个兴趣点（如一个人既喜欢科幻电影也喜欢烹饪书），单一向量无法有效表达。多兴趣模型使用<strong>聚类</strong>或<strong>胶囊网络</strong>为每个用户维护多个兴趣向量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Interest</mtext><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>Attention</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>u</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Interest}_k(u) = \\text{Attention}(q_k, \\{e_i\\}_{i \\in I_u})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Interest</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0001em;vertical-align:-0.2501em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Attention</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2501em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>阿里 MIND（Multi-Interest Network with Dynamic routing）就是这一思路的代表。</p>\n<h2 id=\"tf-idf-到语义匹配的演进\">TF-IDF 到语义匹配的演进</h2><p>传统 TF-IDF 推荐的匹配分数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>profile</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>tfidf</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score}(u, i) = \\cos(\\text{profile}(u), \\text{tfidf}(i))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">profile</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">tfidf</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这种词袋级匹配无法理解同义词和语义关联（&quot;手机&quot;和&quot;智能终端&quot;被视为完全不同的特征）。</p>\n<p>现代语义匹配通过预训练语言模型解决这一问题。利用 Sentence-BERT 编码后：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>BERT</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>user_history</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>BERT</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>item_desc</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score}(u, i) = \\cos(\\text{BERT}(\\text{user\\_history}), \\text{BERT}(\\text{item\\_desc}))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">BERT</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">user_history</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">BERT</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">item_desc</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>能够在语义层面理解&quot;跑步鞋&quot;与&quot;马拉松装备&quot;的关联性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"内容过滤的局限性\">内容过滤的局限性</h2><p><strong>过度特化（Over-specialization）</strong> 是内容过滤最突出的问题——系统只会推荐与用户历史高度相似的物品，导致&quot;信息茧房&quot;效应。一个只看科幻电影的用户永远不会被推荐纪录片，即使他可能喜欢。</p>\n<p><strong>特征工程瓶颈</strong>：高质量的物品特征提取需要大量领域知识和人工标注。虽然深度学习减轻了这一负担，但特征质量仍是系统天花板。</p>\n<p><strong>无法捕捉协同信号</strong>：纯内容过滤忽略了&quot;买了 A 的人也买了 B&quot;这类群体行为模式中蕴含的珍贵信息。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>内容过滤基于&quot;物品相似则用户也会喜欢&quot;的假设，天然解决新物品冷启动</li>\n<li>特征表示从手工 TF-IDF 演进到深度语义编码（BERT/CLIP），质量持续提升</li>\n<li>多兴趣建模打破了单向量的局限，更真实地刻画用户多面兴趣</li>\n<li>过度特化和缺乏协同信号是其固有短板，需要与 CF 结合形成混合方法</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"hybrid-methods\">混合推荐方法</a>——如何融合内容过滤与协同过滤的各自优势</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../ab-testing-statistics/testing-operations/experimentation-platform\">A/B 测试与实验平台</a>——推荐策略变更的在线效果评估方法论</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"基于内容的推荐算法","id":"基于内容的推荐算法"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念与工作机制","id":"核心概念与工作机制"},{"level":2,"text":"物品特征表示","id":"物品特征表示"},{"level":3,"text":"结构化特征","id":"结构化特征"},{"level":3,"text":"非结构化特征提取","id":"非结构化特征提取"},{"level":2,"text":"用户兴趣建模","id":"用户兴趣建模"},{"level":3,"text":"显式画像","id":"显式画像"},{"level":3,"text":"隐式画像与衰减","id":"隐式画像与衰减"},{"level":3,"text":"多兴趣表示","id":"多兴趣表示"},{"level":2,"text":"TF-IDF 到语义匹配的演进","id":"tf-idf-到语义匹配的演进"},{"level":2,"text":"内容过滤的局限性","id":"内容过滤的局限性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"协同过滤算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommendation-algorithms/foundations/collaborative-filtering"},"next":{"title":"混合推荐方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommendation-algorithms/foundations/hybrid-methods"}}